  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "doc-03d82c5bcdd6ca60a93334",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "1-3回合：1级拿李元芳和苏烈，阿离技能给李元芳，守约来了之后卖掉李元芳，阿离技能给守约，有李元芳也可以再拿一张，3回合竞拍百里守约＞程咬金＞明世隐＞盾山＞铠",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 12,
          "paragraph_end": 12
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-a6552d1a1bb1af644ab040",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "4-7回合：棋手升3级，开始找齐阵容中的所有二阶和三阶卡，优先觉醒百里守约、明世隐和程咬金，7回合竞拍可以选择太乙真人，没有就拿一张河洛牌",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 13,
          "paragraph_end": 13
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-94f8059fcbda0e0691b64c",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "8回合以后：棋手升5级补齐太乙真人，期间有加等级的效果牌也可以拿，英雄牌比如蒙犽也可以拿，后期操作就是觉醒英雄和提升守约的等级11回合竞拍可以拿破镜之境、众星闪耀、众星拱月，缺装备可以拿军械库。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 14,
          "paragraph_end": 14
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-37c5f0aea9f25c5d17ef79",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "当狄仁杰先来时，也可以玩阿离狄仁杰，阵容组成是一样的，就是把守约换成狄仁杰就可以了，其他不用变；前期有遗志也可以拿一下，阿离秘技可以选择红叶染锋，后期如果打不赢也可以转海月。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 16,
          "paragraph_end": 16
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-5c2a2a3d6715e5bbf28cc0",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "盾山、铠：盾山和铠是牺牲英雄，用来触发守约的降低蓝条的作用；",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 3,
          "paragraph_end": 3
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-c082e6a46e48cd107bd849",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "明世隐：将铠牺牲后提供的临时等级转化为真实等级；",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 4,
          "paragraph_end": 4
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-30700ee2ea1f6fb8a865dd",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "钟馗：降低对面主要输出英雄等级，为相邻的英雄提供牺牲效果；",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 5,
          "paragraph_end": 5
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-c180d02990928aff42de90",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "程咬金：程咬金整备提供古币，给守约提升等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 6,
          "paragraph_end": 6
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-dcb33eadd3acdd33606019",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "太乙真人：后期必备英雄，独一无二的提供复活机制。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 7,
          "paragraph_end": 7
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-2f3b192a3d3cc8d61e8a71",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "这套阵容总体思路和牺牲李信类似，前排带牺牲英雄阵亡时会减百里守约的蓝条，可以多释放技能，阿离的技能和古币可以增加守约的技能伤害和英雄等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 9,
          "paragraph_end": 9
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-e4fe4f0a0986fcfb62336f",
      "section": "核心机制",
      "text": "这一套阵容之所以比较强的选择在于百里守约的技能，10级就有着超高的攻击力加成，100级狙击子弹的伤害不再衰减，可以对一条直线上的敌人造成一样的伤害。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "mechanic",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 10,
          "paragraph_end": 10
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-0ffb843c5ef3a70718e6c3",
      "section": "关键操作顺序",
      "text": "换了英雄一定要记得重新给伞，因为是主动释放，所以很多时候会忘记。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 18,
          "paragraph_end": 18
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-94f3d32e5c873a2c84012f",
      "section": "关键操作顺序",
      "text": "钟馗要记得给明世隐和程咬金挂牺牲，因为盾山和铠都是自带牺牲的英雄。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 19,
          "paragraph_end": 19
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-4781ff73bf3ae5dba10a52",
      "section": "推荐天赋及原因",
      "text": "优先拿古币类的天赋，如古币翻新、古币契约，守约等级提升更快，其次刻舟减蓝，降低守约的法力值上限，百里守约的伤害来源于技能释放。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 21,
          "paragraph_end": 21
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-b018d6a0aee3bfae3dbfd3",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "百里守约用无尽巨剑放大暴击伤害，魔律之刃提高连续施法机会；对手控制能阻止施法时补炽热支配者，没有此类威胁可比较其他输出装备。双无尽效果叠加与额外收益待确认。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 23,
          "paragraph_end": 23
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-b67f3ba021f97f49669933",
      "section": "克制手段",
      "text": "反伤重甲，反伤重甲的效果是将受到伤害的30%以真实伤害回敬给目标，建议为前排坦克穿戴；其次是磐石之心，磐石之心的效果是每次受到伤害不会超过15%最大生命值，适合给后排主要输出英雄穿戴，防止主要输出英雄被秒。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 25,
          "paragraph_end": 25
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-b3241b07d474e7f3badec4",
      "section": "棋手技能推荐",
      "text": "这套阵容依赖棋手阿离，阿离的技能要记得主动释放，百里守约大量击杀英雄解锁秘技牌，优先选择枫华之刃、一叶双生，有遗志也可以拿红叶染锋，后期可以转海月，6级棋手天赋三选一，可以选择枫之洪流。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 27,
          "paragraph_end": 27
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-fd3a57a567ccd7d53d29c8",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "材料已给出的棋手升级操作按前、中、后期执行；未明确各中间等阶的独立找牌目标、停留边界或六阶后资源安排时，仍待确认。升级前同时比较当前战力、掉血风险、核心与觉醒进度，以及升级后买牌预算；不能仅因到达某回合就忽略保命战力。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 12,
          "paragraph_end": 12
        },
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 13,
          "paragraph_end": 13
        },
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 14,
          "paragraph_end": 14
        },
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-030037a64015c7b7cdb5b867e23509401163c56b363736d5d7fc791bce939b76",
          "paragraph_start": 16,
          "paragraph_end": 16
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-8917a4961d4c5284e8cdaf",
      "section": "棋手技能推荐",
      "text": "将枫叶舞给百里守约，更换主要输出后重新指定，利用其击杀推进秘技；强化选择与该英雄的普攻或技能伤害方式相符，不把所有强化优先级照搬给不同核心。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
